# Per file, in diff regions: Op 6, Exp 1, Unique 0, Stencil 7, FourierStencil 9, Series 4, Conv 4, Bound 1,
# Envelope 1, Final 0. The 32 changes counted by the proof agents are these 33 regions, with the last two
# FourierStencil regions (a `convert ... .integrable` and the `simp only [Pi.add_apply, Pi.sub_apply]` it needs)
# counted as one change. Kinds: Mathlib renames (`if_neg` to `ite_eq_right`, `if_true` to `ite_true`, `push_neg` to
# `push Not`), rewrite targets reshaped to the form Lean elaborates (`- 2 * c` as `+ -(2 * c)`), an `IntegrableOn` to
# `Integrable` coercion, rewrites reordered with an explicit side goal, and in Exp one rewrite (`zero_smul`, which
# does not unify with two ℝ-actions on the operator space) replaced by a pointwise proof of the same equation
# `(0 : ℝ) • (I • A) = 0`. No statement, interface, lemma choice or route changed. To reproduce: unzip the archive,
# strip the two excluded blocks from both sides, and diff.
